{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1543784-a-search-for-lost-time-mtaw-2e-chronicle-ic","id":1543784,"title":"A Search for Lost Time [MtAw 2E Chronicle IC]","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play","Play by Post"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-10-14T14:49:13-07:00","id":1543784,"title":"A Search for Lost Time [MtAw 2E Chronicle IC]","content":"The Purpose of this thread is for In Character descriptions and dialog for the chronicle <i>A Search For Lost Time. </i>Dice rolls and out of character discussions between players and the ST should be posted in the OOC thread.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-14T15:16:37-07:00","id":1543785,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>Chapter 1 &quot;Manifest Destiny&quot;</b></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:11px\">Gilad looks out from his window seat to the seemingly endless sea of clouds that wisp past the jet liner. Beside him, Trish leans on his shoulder and gently dozes. Across the aisle, Galahad stretches out, enjoying the first class seats that they somehow got bumped up to from coach. A bit of luck. It is about a twenty hour flight from Buenos Aires to San Francisco.<br /> <br /> Trish whispers something gently in her sleep in that language that Gilad thinks is her home language, and then slowly stirs awake.<br /> <br /> &quot;I need to use the <i>garderobe&quot; s</i>he says in Old Norse, and then gets up from her seat. &quot;Will you look after my <i>mobile speaking machine</i>?&quot; she says, handing Gilad a small thing that looks like a mirror that people use for seemingly everything these days, including, on occasion, speaking with people over far distances.<br /> <br /> Gilad looks out the window again, thinking over the events of the past few months and how to turn them into a heroic song. After awhile he begins to wonder why Trish has been gone so long. He looks over to Galahad, but he is not in his seat. Which is curious, because Gilad did not notice him getting up. The airplane shakes a little, like a ship on rough waves.</span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27436,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","user":"CalvinSiler","date":". 11-14-2024, 06:37 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-15T14:54:36-07:00","id":1543912,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-size:12px\">The sudden turbulence reminds Gilad that his legs are asleep. He unbuckles his seatbelt and gets up, stretching and allowing the blood to flow to his limbs. He pauses to think for a moment, back in his village, the iron ship he is in would have been an artifact out of legend, a masterwork worthy of Imalrinen himself. In this era, thousands of them part the sea of clouds. But then he wonders if some things never change and walks over to Galahad.<br /> <br /> &quot;Did Trish look like she might have been cloud-seasick ? She has been in the <i>garderobe</i> for a while&quot;</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-15T17:18:06-07:00","id":1543930,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">With fingers drumming on the window arm rest, Olorion stares out the window thinking about how much he already missed the library and picking up Galahad with assorted unknowns ate into his alone quiet stack time. One never knew what surprise Supernal symbol one might find in old books. Olorion sighed, <i>In all fairness I am just pissed that this newest \u201cfriend of a friend\u201d of my favorite fence turned out to be totally useless. Money wasted. But I will find The Book again.</i></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">A bump in the road jolts Olorion out of his thoughts and he feels the need to focus. He truthfully had been feeling off for a couple days. Everyone seemed edgy but that just happened in academia. Someone made the wrong comment about someone\u2019s favorite line of epic poetry, and everyone is about to throw things. However the supernatural always had the best timing so who could really tell. Olorion looked up and smiled, this is why he loved being a mage. He did not just have to sit with the feeling, in the immediate he could have protect himself in anticipation of escorting his colleague back to Berkely. Later when he had time he could do some research. He took a breath and closed his eyes. Clearing his mind, he looked up and smiled at the driver in the mirror.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">\u201cI think I am going to rest my eyes a bit, I am going to put up the shade. I would be very grateful if I was not disturbed\u201d, Olorion passed the driver a $20 bill and nodded his head. The privacy partition went up and the audio system would prevent any sounds from the back unless Olorion wanted the driver to hear. Olorion grew up in New York, he had no idea how to drive or the desire to learn. Olorion was glad for the fact his Arrow cabal mate was returning, having a gallant warrior around made life easier for mages.<br /> <br /> Olorion closed his eyes and centered himself. He began by reciting prime numbers. Then define random words. Opening his eyes he found the rhythm, in a second, he began to utter words that were beyond normal meaning. Keeping the rhythm, he began to twist the iron ring on his finger. Focusing his mind, he forms an Imago in his mind.<br /> <br /> Grabbing the threads of time that weaved in his mind\u2019s eye parallel to threads of space, he plucked threads seemingly at random. With finger spinning his iron ring and his words following the rhythm he had found he wrapped the threads of time around himself. He sucked in air as a flutter of primal power left him to power the spell. Casting the Perfect Timing around himself, if he was going into a strange situation, he reasoned he could start with a little precaution. He was going to be doing some divining later when he could do ritual work. </span></span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28497-emerys","name":"Emerys","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"40"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-15T21:16:12-07:00","id":1543948,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a><br /> <br /> The person who Gilad speaks to gives him a strange look and he realizes that it is not Galahad.<br /> <br /> He hears a chime, and a little lighted sign above his seat has turned on. One of the crew of the Iron ship comes up the aisle and speaks to him in a language that Trish and Galahad speak sometimes called English. He is not sure what all the words mean, but she seems to be saying that he needs to sit and strap himself to the chair because of the storm.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-15T21:20:54-07:00","id":1543949,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28497-emerys\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28497\" data-vbnamecard=\"28497\">Emerys</a><br /> Olorion looks down at the seat next to him and sees a book. He picks it up. It is an old worn edition of a dictionary of Old Norse. On the inside it has the mark of a book seller written in what appears to be kangi and a stylized picture of a fox with six tails.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-15T23:52:51-07:00","id":1543952,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1437_5.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1437\" data-vbnamecard=\"1437\">wyrdhamster</a><br /> <br /> Helmut is in his favorite flower shop waiting on a bouquet that he ordered. It is owned by a Japanese woman in her mid thirties named Nadeshiko. She is married to a Ronin Talon named Caliburn who is part of Alunno's cabal in Berkeley. She has a younger sister who works as a newspaper reporter. Nadeshiko is a very traditional Japanese woman, and worries a lot about her more &quot;American&quot; sister, who is always traveling around the world with strange people and getting herself into trouble. Her sister is almost thirty and she should settle down!<br /> <br /> He hears what sounds like a car crash outside and looks out the window to see what happened. The he gets a strange feeling in his stomach. When he turns around the flower shop is gone!<br /> <br /> It now looks like he is in a new store under construction. There is a sign saying &quot;Kitsune Books: Coming Soon&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-15T23:59:38-07:00","id":1543953,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CalvinSiler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1543784-a-search-for-lost-time-mtaw-2e-chronicle-ic?p=1543952#post1543952\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1437_5.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1437\" data-vbnamecard=\"1437\">wyrdhamster</a><br /> It now looks like he is in a new store under construction. There is a sign saying &quot;Kitsune Books: Coming Soon&quot;.</div> </div> </div> </div>Helmut instantly check <b>Kitsune Books</b> on his Android smartphone. Yes, he is so hipster like to use Google phone that in San Fran capitol of Apple. <br /> <br /> If not finding any real address or anything - he use Time Sight to determine what's probably is timeline disturbance.<br /> <br /> If nothing works - he calls by Free Council chain of apps chats to get with touch with Alunno and his cabal. Will try to check if Caliburn wife is missing.<br /> <br /> ( I will ask on OOC channel how to solve those. )","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-16T00:08:37-07:00","id":1543956,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar4967_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"4967\" data-vbnamecard=\"4967\">lbeaumanior</a><br /> <br /> Amir is at the law firm. It is past 5 in the afternoon, but most young lawyers work late hours to get ahead. He does not have his own office yet and works in a long row of cubicles with other low level associates. His desk is piled with legal paperwork he needs to finish for his boss.<br /> <br /> He gets a message on one of his phones that only has fellow mage contacts. It is from the hierarch's provost. &quot;URGENT!&quot; <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> &quot;Six talons found dead in important mission in Andes mountains. Seer or scelesti involvement suspected. Detain cabal member Gilad at airport. Galahad will meet you there as backup. Gilad is suspected of treachery against the order&quot; </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> He goes to use the restroom and hides in one of the stalls to perform a quick divination spell. But something goes wrong with the spell and Amir feels the threads of fate going against him.<br /> <br /> He tries to sleep out of the office unnoticed, but his supervisor catches him. <br /> <br /> &quot;Just where do you think you are going?&quot; He says pointing towards Amir's desk where an assistant is piling even more paperwork. &quot;Also, I'm away for the weekend, and I need you to feed my cat&quot;. He hands Amir the keys.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-16T11:09:42-07:00","id":1544000,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">Olorion opens his eyes and sighs. The spell wrapped around him, and he felt the joy of magic done well. The flow of the temporal thread seemed to nudge him just a bit in the direction of the driver, like Olorion had met him before but could not place where.</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">Looking down he notices a book in the seat next to his for the first time. \u201cWell, hello there beautiful, whom might you be.\u201d Picking it up and inspecting the book Olorion finds it is an old but worn addition of an Old Norse dictionary. The inside cover reveals kanji characters and a small arrangement of characters that he knew was the name of a bookseller. This is also somewhat familiar to him, but Olorion is at a loss to place where. A stylized picture of a fox with six tails is present with the kanji.<br /> <br /> <i>Huh, a kitsune. Very pretty, good quality. The book is worn but not too unkempt. The pages are intact, and the spine is still supportive to the overall structure. But why did you appear to me my newest friend. </i></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">Olorion looks up and sees the partition still closed. Breathing in and out, Olorion focuses his mind and reaches for the Imago established for one his favorite spells, a rote of the <i>Universal Language </i>spell.</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">Olorion\u2019s mind began filling with the Imago of the rote. In his mind Olorion sees himself sitting in a circle of concentric rings of books. The rings go out as far as Olorion \u201ccan see\u201d and if one were to look closely at them they would be rings of books on language, symbols, and the spoken word. Olorion\u2019s hands move up to his eyes and make rhythmic motions circling around his eyes, then moved to his ears, then his mouth. Then placing one hand on his forehead to symbolize the mind\u2019s ability to use language, and a second on his heart to symbolize the power language had on the emotional part of humanity. Breathing out Olorion pulls the symbols of language into his mind and settles them over his mind like a glove, warm and comfortable.<br /> <br /> The inside of the car is filled with the scent of old parchment and leather.</span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28497-emerys","name":"Emerys","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"40"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-16T15:06:43-07:00","id":1544023,"title":"","content":"Olorion reads the kanji and it says &quot;Kitsune Books, Tokyo Japan&quot; which appears to be the name of the book store where the book was purchased. With his new understanding of the symbols of language, he feels confident that he would be able to speak and understand the ancient language of Old Norse without spell craft, at least temporarily.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-16T17:33:42-07:00","id":1544039,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">Olorion rubs his hands along the book. New words and ideas buzzed through his head. Again, euphoric at magic done well. After a moment he looked toward the driver and pondered the insight of some level of recognition. Placing the book in his lap with his hands over it protectively and possessively,<br /> <br /> Olorion rolls down the partition and smiles at the driver amiably. Deciding to not trial his new language first in interests of testing a hypothesis quickly. While making eye contact with the driver Olorion asks:</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">&lt;OLD NORSE&gt; Have not we met before friend? &lt;OLD NORSE&gt;</span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28497-emerys","name":"Emerys","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"40"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-16T18:11:06-07:00","id":1544042,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28497-emerys\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28497\" data-vbnamecard=\"28497\">Emerys</a> <br /> &quot;Oh. Sorry sir. Are you talking to me? Unfortunately I only speak English. Do you have a translator on your phone?&quot;<br /> <br /> The man driving the cab appears to be on his late twenties, early thirties. He is <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eddie_Redmayne?wprov=sfla1\" target=\"_blank\">striking looking</a>, and fashionably dressed in a sort of bohemian looking outfit with a <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fourth_Doctor?wprov=sfla1\" target=\"_blank\">long knit scarf</a>.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-16T19:45:53-07:00","id":1544062,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">Noticing the striking appearance and the long-knit scarf of the driver for the first time, Olorion pauses. Smiling, Olorion apologizes. \u201cI am so sorry; it has been a long day and I am a librarian who works with languages. It sometimes bleeds through when I don\u2019t have enough coffee.\u201d</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">Olorion internally checks off a box. Hypothesis disproven. The book appearing was definitely supernatural feeling especially after casting his initial spell.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">Olorion closes his eyes and reaches into the part of himself connected to the Supernal. He activates <b>Active Mage Sight</b>. He feels his eyes connecting to the principles of <b>Mind</b> and <b>Space. </b>He channels a portion of primordial Supernal power through himself to also see principles of <b>Time.</b></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">Olorion opens his eyes and looks over the scene in front of him. The length of the car to the partition and through the partition at the driver and a part of the road before them.</span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28497-emerys","name":"Emerys","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"40"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-16T22:09:37-07:00","id":1544075,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">\u2018Yeah. Okay. I understand. I will be for you Amir in 30 minutes. Look for unicorn outside your building, Milady.\u2019</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">Helmut closes the call \u2013 and looks on his asian Android phone, pensively. It will be a long day in 2020s, won\u2019t it?</span> <hr /><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">Half hour later \u2013 precisely to the second \u2013<b> Amir</b> got out of his office building. In front of it, on parking space across the street, stands this great big ball of rainbow, hairs and smiles that he recognized as <b>Helmut </b>in old school motor helmet, painted in multicolour Vikings runes. Like from some book for teenagers about young wizards in boarding schools, massive guy stands over classical 1970s Harley Davidson with passenger trailer \u2013 painted like \u2018gays barfed\u2019 on it. Californian license plates on motorcycle states most directly: \u2018<b>UN1C0RN</b>\u2019.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">Helmut turns to his Iranian colleague:</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">\u2018My lady, the carriage is ready.\u2019 \u2013 smirking saying that.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><img title=\"dataurl719853.jpg\" data-tempid=\"temp_1703_1729141722479_515\" data-align=\"none\" data-size=\"full\" loading=\"lazy\" border=\"0\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=1703\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=1703\" data-thumb-url=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=1703&amp;type=thumb\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"dataurl719853.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment thumbnail js-need-data-att-update js-lightbox-participant\" itemprop=\"image\"/> </span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 10-17-2024, 01:18 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-17T07:41:52-07:00","id":1544105,"title":"","content":"<b>Amir </b>had it with his boss, he is considering quitting. He discretely grabs his Dedicated coin, and cast his most frequently used spell, looking for some Luck.. He puts his all there and feels it succeed and speaks to his supervisor loudly:<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;I must leave urgently, personal matters have arisen; additionally, I believe that taking care of your cat falls outside my responsibilities as an associate. But if I am misinformed about the cat, please send it to me in writting so I can bill the hours. Have a great weekend!&quot;</i>:<br /> <br /> He gets a call from <b>Helmut </b>regarding a mage named <b>Caliburn </b>and it seems urgent, he mentions <i>'It may be truly dire thing'</i>, Amir asks for a moment and uses his <i>Perfect Recall</i> Attainment to try and remember all the related matters that are happening at this moment. A couple of quick checks first on <b>Galahad </b>(he was leaving the area on some secret Arrow mission, but Amir was not privy to specific details); on <b>Gilad </b>(never heard of him), and of course the caller <b>Helmut </b>(who can forget him? The time traveller).<br /> <br /> Amir answers <b>Helmut </b>question with a request, <i>&quot;Sure I can try to help you with <b>Caliburn</b>, but currently I need to pick someone at the airport, someone part of the club and the more the merrier for this little adventure&quot;</i>. After <b>Helmut </b>confirms his assistance, <b>Amir </b>goes looking for <b>Rachel </b>to ask for the car keys, he need a bit of time alone, and the sleepwalker car seems the best place, once in posession of the keys, he goes to the parking lot and starts preparing to use his <i>Divination </i>attainment, the spell failure does not daunt him, but a bit of predictive reasurance does not hurt anyone.<br /> <br /> <b>Amir </b>takes the time to ask 3 questions:<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><ol class=\"decimal\"><li>Am I in danger from this task?</li> <li>Do I need more support?</li> <li>Am I doing the right thing by following this order?</li> </ol>Receiving, a NO, and two YES as replies.<br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Satified with the attainment results, he locks in his car and starts casting his favourite spell in sequence, an empowering sequence, drawing on his High Speech knowledge, his on assuredness of his role and Shadow Name, and a bit of usage of the Dedicated Tool.<br /> <br /> He uses the spells to ask for luck, inspiration, fortitude, and information; and for all of it to last at least a day. The next couple of minutes he takes time to call former classmates, asking for opportunities available and try to recall what he can about <b>Caliburn</b>.<br /> <br /> Thirty minutes after their call, a smiling <b>Helmut </b>arrives with his chacteristic joie de vivre, and he tells <b>Amir </b><i>&quot;My lady, the carriage is ready&quot;</i><br /> <br /> <i>&quot;Dear guy, you need to work on you shocking-people-speech, misgendering people is a no-no nowadays&quot;</i> says <b>Amir </b>while smiling.<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;Also, I told you I am picking someone, we need a car to bring them&quot;</i> says <b>Amir </b>now coming closer and lowering the tone <i>&quot;I casted something, I don't expect issues, but you are here as a my backup, we will meet an Arrow there and you might want to throw your own dice to better your chances, we can take a while in the parking lot if you wish&quot;.</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4967,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","user":"lbeaumanior","date":".  Fixed Rachel's part 10-18-2024, 06:09 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-17T09:51:22-07:00","id":1544116,"title":"","content":"<b>Helmut</b> shrugs in with indifference:<br /> <i>'This modern times... If you need to pickup someone, I will shadow you on Unicorn.' -</i> <b>Helmut</b> smiles proudly at his cunning.<br /> <br /> <b>Amir </b>doubt that such a garish and archaic motorcycle could hide anywhere.<br /> <br /> <i>'We can talk on the walkie-talkie.' </i>- <b>Helmut</b> takes out his smartphone and turns it towards <b>Amir, </b>swinging it left and right. - <i>'I can have literal one mind with two thoughts.'</i><br /> <br /> Did <b>Helmut</b> just pointed to typical Mind magic rote? \ud83e\udd14","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 10-17-2024, 02:35 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-17T10:24:29-07:00","id":1544120,"title":"","content":"<i>&quot;Are you skilled enough to make direct mental communication possible?&quot;</i> <b>Amir </b>asks in hushed tones, while thinking that this conversation in the parking lot would be a Guardian's nightmare; <i>&quot;if so, that would be more discrete and less prone to police intervention, or traffic accidents, than watching you ride a motobike and try to answer a phone&quot;.</i><br /> <br /> As an Acanthus<b> Amir </b>is aware there are ways to ignore normal road inconveniences such as police but <b>Helmut </b>does not seem to have any active spells, nor Amir has any familiarity with any possible Legacy effects that the man might have, flamboyancy is one thing he does not mind, but blantant disregard for the general road safety is a complety different matter.<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;In your case, my friend, this is an escort mission for the Counsilium, please refrain from questioning my passenger or the Arrow regarding the reason&quot; </i> <b>Amir </b>is aware of the risks but <b>Helmut </b>seems smart enough to understand when jokes need to stop, and besides the <i>Divination</i> was positive regarding his presence there.<br /> <br /> With a final check up of his phone to see if the Provost sent an answer, he waves Rachel to depart in the car followed by his newest 'bodyguard'.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4967,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","user":"lbeaumanior","date":". 10-18-2024, 12:04 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-17T11:32:24-07:00","id":1544123,"title":"","content":"<i>'I do not need the mambo jambo of listening your thoughts. I literally can drive the bike and chat with you if I need. And as Acanthi you should know that fortune favors the bold. Especially those with secrets of Fate and Time.'</i> - <b>Helmut</b> is grinning extensively to little Persian guy.<br /> <br /> <i>'I'm literal Man of the Hour! I do not afraid such small things like traffic lights or wrong timed turns!' </i>- Large hippie puffs out his chest like a peacock fluffs its tail.<br /> <br /> Seeing the slight incomprehension on <b>Amir</b>'s face, <b>Helmut</b> sums it up briefly -<br /> <i>'I can really drive and talk on the phone safely at the same time. And yes, I will be silent if you need me.' </i><br /> <br /> He looks like big sad bear when that is waiting for paused play date, when he finally got on his Unicorn bike.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 10-17-2024, 02:36 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-17T11:44:23-07:00","id":1544125,"title":"","content":"Gilad is taken aback for a second, he normally has a good memory for faces. He wonders what Galahad might have seen.<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;I didn't see any spirits of the land out there, I don't see any in here. Maybe its nothing, a quick check should be enough.&quot;</i><br /> <br /> Gilad turns back to the crew member, nods and gesture towards the bathroom.<br /> <br /> He then looks at the passenger, making a gesture to apologize for the confusion, and takes a quick look around, in would appears to others as looking for the correct person. But Gilad is surveying a battlefied, testemonies flowing as ink sentences from all over the iron ship, each of them flowing ingo the scroll that is his Imago, compiling a report. It notes the building tension of the passengers as the storm continues, but there are no accounts of any wounded or any signs of engagement. However, there are missing people, two less than when he boarded the ship.<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;Perkele ! There is a dog buried in this.&quot;</i><br /> <br /> He starts steadily making his way towards the back of the ship.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 10-17-2024, 05:20 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-17T14:53:20-07:00","id":1544143,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28497-emerys\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28497\" data-vbnamecard=\"28497\">Emerys</a><br /> <br /> &quot;You seem like you want to talk. Do I still get to keep the twenty bucks?&quot; the driver says with a smile.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-17T14:59:10-07:00","id":1544144,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a><br /> <br /> As Gilad makes his way to the restroom, the female crew member speaks to him in what he thinks is English and gestures towards his seat, and the glowing sign. Maybe he recognizes the words &quot;Captain&quot; and &quot;Safety&quot;. <br /> <br /> It appears that there is no one in the first class restroom. Trish said that she was going there just a few minutes ago.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-17T16:50:45-07:00","id":1544153,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar27436_1.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27436\" data-vbnamecard=\"27436\">CalvinSiler</a><br /> <br /> \u201cOf course, couldn\u2019t ask a man to give back a tip. Would not be the gentleman thing to do. My mood changed after I got some interesting information.\u201d<br /> <br /> <br /> Olorion allows his Mage Sight to fade. Observing that neither spatial nor temporal distortions are present around or through the driver. The driver at least has a mind and is conscious. A twinkle in the eye of the driver does catch Olorion\u2019s eye in the rear view mirror. Feeling the luck acquired new book in his hands he felt relaxed, enjoying the feel of the cover and the paper inside. Slowly breathing in and out he twists the ring on his finger, he looks up at the driver and smiles.<br /> <br /> <br /> \u201cWhat is your name my friend?\u201d<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28497-emerys","name":"Emerys","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"40"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-17T17:16:59-07:00","id":1544158,"title":"","content":"&quot;I've had lots of names. In different times and places. Your mentor Alunno once called me Blot.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-17T17:25:33-07:00","id":1544159,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar4967_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"4967\" data-vbnamecard=\"4967\">lbeaumanior</a><br /> <br /> A few minutes before.<br /> <br /> &quot;...and another thing Naqvi. You'll never work in this town again!!!&quot;<br /> <br /> A few minutes later.<br /> <br /> A short, slightly overweight, Chinese American woman in her early twenties is standing on the corner with the contents of her desk and the contents of Michael's desk in boxes, and a small fishbowl with a goldfish.<br /> <br /> &quot;Um...Amir...Mr. Naqvi. What do we do now?<br /> <br /> Just then a brightly colored motorcyle pulls up.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-17T17:31:44-07:00","id":1544160,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar27436_1.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27436\" data-vbnamecard=\"27436\">CalvinSiler</a><br /> Olorion\u2019s complete attention immediately focused on the driver. <i>Well at least I am likely not going to risk paradox if I need to do something desperate</i>. Olorion thought.<br /> <br /> <br /> \u201cBlot. Any connection to the Old Norse word for \u2018sacrifice\u2019 or \u2018worship\u2019? With the follow up question being, I would consider it a courteous favor if you would enlighten me to you intentions?\u201d (Questioning tone)<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28497-emerys","name":"Emerys","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"40"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-17T17:34:33-07:00","id":1544161,"title":"","content":"Gilad nods to the crew member and makes his way back to his seat. He takes out his phone before buckling his seatbelt.<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;What was it that they said about emergency numbers ? There must be someone I can tell about this.....maybe Lucas&quot;</i><br /> <br /> He starts looking through the contacts list, but cannot place a call, the effect of airplane mode slipping his mind.<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;This is no time for this, I will let the crystal box figure it out&quot;</i><br /> <br /> Gilad starts forming an Imago on his lap in the shape of a kantele, the instrument invented by V\u00e4in\u00e4m\u00f6inen, the divine bard. His hand move in his lap, mimicking the movements of picking at the strings of the instrument, imbuing the song with the great troubador's authority.<br /> <br /> The song now resonates with Gilad's voice in the background, urging the spirit to send a message to Lucas: &quot;Trish and Galahad vanished from the cloud ship, Galahad Veiled himself before it happened. I am still in the cloud ship, the Peripheral Sight hasn't triggered, no spirits or ghosts seen and a storm is raging. Working on digging up this dog&quot;.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 10-17-2024, 10:25 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-17T19:10:35-07:00","id":1544172,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a><br /> <br /> Lucas texts back in Swedish.<br /> <br /> &quot;Gilad! What is going on?!!!!<br /> I'm getting messages from Argentina and U.S. saying you led the Seers right to the team and they are all dead. The Seers have the gold!<br /> <br /> I'm in Oslo right now. I will be on the next flight to San Francisco. They want to put you on trial for treason, Gilad.<br /> <br /> Who the hell is Trish?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-17T20:25:43-07:00","id":1544174,"title":"","content":"<i>&quot;What ? How ? He should have known about Trish from hearing about the train station incident. That gold was hidden under a stone, why would I want the Seers to spirit it off ?&quot;</i> Gilad notices he had his hand in his chin while thinking, he feels the scar on his face, cut by a the talon of a bird too big to exist in nature.<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;A traitor hallucinating his way through a mission with an imaginary friend ? Killing everyone once it finished ?&quot;</i> Gilad takes a deep breath and tries to mentally recall the incident, using the techniques he was taught to retain oral tales. <i>&quot;I need to hit the facts on the table&quot;</i><br /> <br /> He rummages through his drafts of the lyrics, looking for anything that doesn't match what he remembers.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-18T08:02:29-07:00","id":1544204,"title":"","content":"Seeing nothing amiss with his drafts and finding he has no missing time, then he can only think of one answer, he looks at Trish's phone and narrows his eyes.<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;Twice did the people around me get lost in the currents of time, twice was chaos left after the storm of ages. But this time I haven't been swept away, this time I know how to fight like an Arrow. But the only way to brave its currents is to prove, beyond a shadow of a doubt, that <u>Honor is my True Name</u>&quot;</i><br /> <br /> He writes back in his phone.<br /> <br /> &quot;I did not kill my allies. Taking the gold from the Scelesti and giving it to the Seers would be like going from the ditch to the duck pond. I did neither of those things.<br /> <br /> Trish was with Jorunn and me when we helped a ghost pass on in Paris, she should have mentioned her. I remember telling you the tale of how she helped us in the search for the gold.<br /> <br /> Maybe someone is rewriting the story, changing what happened. But I am frozen in this, Time is not an Arcana I have practiced. I remember the story and I have her phone with me, but I don't think that is how this usually works.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 10-18-2024, 05:46 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-18T18:37:18-07:00","id":1544246,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28497-emerys\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28497\" data-vbnamecard=\"28497\">Emerys</a><br /> <br /> The ride is going across the Golden Gate Bridge towards the city, and the sun is setting, just at the right angle to be almost blinding.<br /> <br /> &quot;Blot can mean a lot of things, can't it? My intentions? That's...er...complicated, even for an Awakened mind. The first thing is that you will not remember this conversation after we are done. You'll need to go into your Onieros to retrieve it. Amir and Rachel can help. Second...<br /> <br /> Mid sentence the sunset turns into a blinding flash. When Olorion can see again the ride is pulling up to the arivals terminal at the airport. A friendly Kenyan man is driving the car.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-18T20:05:44-07:00","id":1544256,"title":"","content":"Olorion blinks at the setting sun and smiles. <i>What a lovely car ride, and I found a new book and get to use a new language. Hopefully it lasts long enough for me to get Galahad and his companions back to Berkeley so I can go find some books to read with this new language.</i><br /> <br /> <br /> Almost not noticing the arrival to the airport, Olorion takes a breath and smiles at the driver. Olorion tucks the book into an inner jacket pocket, large enough for most regular sized books. Almost as if the jacket was tailored to hold books.<br /> <br /> <br /> &lt;Swahili&gt; Thank you for the ride &lt;Swahili&gt;<br /> <br /> <br /> Olorion hands over a $20 tip in addition to his fare and steps out. Walking into the airport to see where he needed to wait on his cabalmate.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28497-emerys","name":"Emerys","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"40"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-18T23:28:09-07:00","id":1544259,"title":"","content":"As Olorian approaches the arival and departures board he sees a group of people standing and studying the times.<br /> <br /> There is a large man with a rainbow beard, a middle eastern man in a nice suit, and a Chinese woman in her early twenties.<br /> <br /> Just then Galahad, a slim African American man in his mid twenties who definitely looks like he was captain of the math-letes and chess club, comes running up to Olorion out of breath.<br /> <br /> &quot;Olorion (breath) you (breath) are here (breath) too! I got here as soon as I could. Have you found the lawyer the hierarch sent?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-19T10:16:23-07:00","id":1544299,"title":"","content":"Olorion takes in the surroundings as he enters the airport terminal for arrivals, bustling and noisy. Three figures catch his eye. The rainbow beard caused Olorion to briefly stare overly long but Olorion was quickly drawn to his cabal mate abrupting approaching out of breath.<br /> <br /> <br /> \u201dWhat are you talking about, I was sent to pick you up? Follow up question, why is the Hierarch involved?\u201d<br /> <br /> <br /> Olorion is growing concerned, something is wrong. <i>Fuck wasn\u2019t I supposed to just come fetch Galahad and some assorted new people. If the Hierarch is sending counsel then something BIG is happening. </i><br /> <br /> Olorion desperately tries to wrack his brain for how he got assigned the task to pick up Galahad. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28497-emerys","name":"Emerys","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"40"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-20T13:14:24-07:00","id":1544353,"title":"","content":"<b>Amir </b>types furiously on his phone, asking the Provost for descriptions of the people, flight number, gate, where to take the man, and of course <b>Galahad </b>phone. Thinking to himself that he seems to be the only competent party in this matter, why send someone woefully unprepared and uninformed? Is this a plot, does someone want him to fail this task? But if it is a plot, why? <b>Amir </b>is neither poltically relevant nor magically skilled (yet) to deserve such conspiracy; furthermore, <b>Rachel </b>is involved, dumb girl she is, she is still family of the Archdeacon, too risky to involve her in something dangerous. So most likely there no plotting here, just incompetence.<br /> <br /> <b>Amir </b>felt too close to Paradox for his tastes last couple of spells, he went beyond the natural scope of his skill and used some Mana to mitigate the results, but his training was quite specific on what to do on those cases: cast a little as possible for a while, and if forced to cast, use your Dedicated Tools and Mana; Paradox is a beast he does not want to awaken.<br /> <br /> <b>Amir </b>speaks confidently but in a low voice to <b>Helmut </b>&quot;<i>My friend, it is your time to shine, can you cast something to help us find our man? I am a bit winded from my own previous efforts</i>&quot;.<br /> <br /> To <b>Rachel </b>in while using his most winsome smile &quot;<i>I dont expect anything to go wrong here, BUT if something amiss happens, remember protocol: don't try to intervene, slip away and THEN call your grandfather</i>&quot;. <b>Amir </b>thinks that when his proficiency increases he should use his long lasting attainments on the girl, Mental and Temporal defenses that are not spells should protect her even if minimally, there is no drawback to it, and lots to win: diminishing the surface attacks against himself, it could endear him to the Archdeacon if he makes efforts above and beyond for the girl, and also he is somewhat fond of her.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-20T20:19:53-07:00","id":1544374,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28497-emerys\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28497\" data-vbnamecard=\"28497\">Emerys</a><br /> &quot;Huh? Why would you pick me up at the airport. I didn't go anywhere. Some Therarch lawyer needs help with a mage that's gone rouge or something. I was close by.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-21T03:07:23-07:00","id":1544381,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>lbeaumanior</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1543784-a-search-for-lost-time-mtaw-2e-chronicle-ic?p=1544353#post1544353\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Amir </b>speaks confidently but in a low voice to <b>Helmut </b>&quot;<i>My friend, it is your time to shine, can you cast something to help us find our man? I am a bit winded from my own previous efforts</i>&quot;.</div> </div> </div> </div><b>Helmut's</b> node, but ask politely:<br /> '<i>Of course Amir, but who do we seeking out? You did not told me anything about this mysterious guest.'</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-21T08:04:06-07:00","id":1544397,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar4967_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"4967\" data-vbnamecard=\"4967\">lbeaumanior</a><br /> <br /> After what seems like a longish time, Colt texts back with the information Amir asked for, including a description of Gilad.<br /> <br /> &quot;Better Luck Tomorrow Resteraunt. Back Door. Don't fail.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-21T10:07:56-07:00","id":1544404,"title":"","content":"<b>Amir </b>reads <b>Gilad </b>description, and conveys such information to <b>Rachel </b>and <b>Helmut</b>, to see if they spot him; and tells them the destination preventively.<br /> <br /> He also asks <b>Helmut </b>to cast a <i>Shifting the Odds </i>looking for another awakened afiliated with the Consilium here, <b>Amir </b>thinks it is unlikely that someone else but <b>Galahad </b>would be around to answer for that, and if there is someone else that answer that description that would be some evidence of the plot (or lack thereof).<br /> <br /> After thinking a bit of the potential political fallout, <b>Amir </b>thinks that another <i>Divination </i>with his Attainments could help him asking to find if this a plot, and find the risk to <b>Helmut </b>or <b>Rachel</b>. And of course another use could identify risks to <b>Galahad</b>, and whether <b>Gilad </b>is guilty or innocent.<br /> <br /> The Attainment shows him that this will be identified as a political plot; that neither <b>Galahad</b>, <b>Helmut</b>, nor <b>Rachel </b>are at risk for the task; and that <b>Amir </b>will find this <b>Gilad </b>innocent.<br /> <br /> Finding this a plot, Amir makes a mental point to contact the Archdeacon <b>Tai Sui</b>, to prevent this conspiracy from harming the Order and the Consilium.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4967,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","user":"lbeaumanior","date":". 10-21-2024, 03:30 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-21T11:19:27-07:00","id":1544411,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>lbeaumanior</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1543784-a-search-for-lost-time-mtaw-2e-chronicle-ic?p=1544404#post1544404\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">He also asks <b>Helmut </b>to cast a <i>Serendipity </i>looking for another awakened affiliated with the Consilium here,</div> </div> </div> </div><b>Helmut</b> - <i>'Yeah, let's look</i><i> for people or places with </i><b>Shifting the Odds</b><i>, ANGEL!'</i><br /> <br /> (Casting details and roll on OOC topic.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 10-21-2024, 03:57 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-21T11:36:45-07:00","id":1544413,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar27436_1.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27436\" data-vbnamecard=\"27436\">CalvinSiler</a> <br /> <br /> Olorion feels confused and is starting to feel actual anxiety creeping into his mind. Breathing in and out while slowly taking in the airport terminal he begins to feel there is something going on and Olorion is feeling out of the loop. As he focuses Galahd\u2019s comment fully sinks in, and Olorion is unhappy with the incongruities of the situation, he needs to know more.<br /> <br /> <br /> Closes his eyes and opening up his mind and his soul together, like opening the book of Olorion. In his mind he felt a light and warmth grow inside him as he activated one of his Legacy Attainments. Due to the shaping work on Olorion\u2019s soul he can recall anything he has seen in written format. Focusing on his mind he shaped the internal light into a giant book and attempts to see if he received the communication to pick up Galahad in any kind of written or text base format.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28497-emerys","name":"Emerys","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"40"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-21T16:30:46-07:00","id":1544437,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1437_5.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1437\" data-vbnamecard=\"1437\">wyrdhamster</a><br /> <br /> Helmut looks over, and a few feet away he notices <a href=\"https://i.pinimg.com/originals/07/fc/75/07fc75b48877c8f4f58f8d1745eacf58.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">two bookish looking lads</a>, one of whom seems to have run for a distance, and the other looks confused and anxious.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-21T17:09:11-07:00","id":1544443,"title":"","content":"<br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar27436_1.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27436\" data-vbnamecard=\"27436\">CalvinSiler</a> <br /> <br /> Olorion reaches into his pocket and pulls out a piece of paper with a flight number and time scrawled on it in his handwriting. <i>Ok, something is definitely up. </i><br /> <br /> Olorion breathes in and out then opens his eyes. He activates his mage sight, strings and chains of space and mind fill the world. Using some of the mana stored in his body he opens eye mage sight up to the Arcanum of Prime, light filling the field of his vision but not blinding him.<br /> <br /> Turning to Galahad, Olorion says \u201cI would suggest you activate your mage sight, I believe we will be having some trouble of our variety very soon.\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28497-emerys","name":"Emerys","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"40"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-22T15:20:29-07:00","id":1544508,"title":"","content":"As the plane lands and passengers start to move, Gilad drops his detection spell and does a quick check on his baggage.<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;Nothing, even the English cheat sheet Trish gave me vanished like the halls of </i>\u00datgar\u00f0a-<i>Loki</i><i>. Maybe only what was on me was spared the shift in time.&quot;</i><br /> <br /> Before retrieving his carry on luggage, Gilad checks on Trish and Galahad's luggage, also finding it gone. With dawning realization, he texts Lucas:<br /> <br /> &quot;Is there any way I can show the Consilium Trish's glass talkbox ? I might take a while in the sky port though, and maybe I will have a few question what certain words mean&quot;<br /> <br /> Closing the speaking box, Gilad starts following the passengers, hoping they will know what to do. He sees different runes posted everywhere, but when he sees an arrow with a vague image of a travel trunk on wheels, he feels it was a good idea. They come to a small metal hill, jutting out of the ground. Seeing no spirits nearby, Gilad takes a quick look with Spirit Sight:<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;No solemn resonance here, this is not a sacred site.&quot;</i><br /> <br /> He looks at the other passengers, who stare at it with a mix of expectation and boredom. Overtaken by curiosity, he climbs the hill, stepping on the dark, angled cobblestone surrounding it. He walks upwards, finding a metal rabbit hole on top, the cobblestones continuing down into the dark, in a passage far too narrow for anyone to fit. He squints his eyes, trying to catch a glimpse of what might be slumbering at the bottom.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 10-22-2024, 09:00 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude00","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-22T16:35:11-07:00","id":1544514,"title":"","content":"Olorion processes the information in front of him. The group of three in front of him seemed very relevant, likely mages but at least sleepwalkers or proximi. I need to get their attention. Olorion closes his eyes and breaths. Centering his mind, he forms an Imago of chains of thought filling everything in existence. Grabbing a random chain and pulling in his hand he reaches his mind out to the man with the rainbow beard to try and say:<br /> <br /> <br /> <i>\u201cGreetings, would you join me and my cabalmate over here\u201d</i><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28497-emerys","name":"Emerys","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"40"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-22T20:55:26-07:00","id":1544531,"title":"","content":"<b>Helmut</b> is taken a bit finding out that other man is in his mind saying:<br /> '<i>Greetings, would you join me and my cabalmate over here.'</i><br /> <br /> Truth be told he is not <b><i>that</i></b> surprised - from end of 1960s he many times had people saying things in his head. Most often man. But most often that was on party, but first time it happens to him on airport. Weird feeling.<br /> <br /> <b>Helmu</b>t's turns to the <b>Amir</b> slightly - looks deep in his big Persian eyes, pointing with his eyes on <b>Olorion</b> - and says:<br /> '<i>This man invites us all to the party.' </i>- Helmut checks him once again -<i> 'I think we can go with him, he look cool. And have very intriguing mind voice '</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 10-23-2024, 08:55 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-24T08:25:15-07:00","id":1544650,"title":"","content":"<i>'Well, it seems <b>Helmut </b>found our man'</i> <b>Amir </b>thinks.<br /> <br /> <b>Amir </b>hails the new guys <i>&quot;I am <b>Amir</b>, acting on behalf of the Silver Ladder. Gentlemen, may I know your </i>professional <i>names and affiliations?&quot;</i><br /> <br /> <b>Amir </b>is relatively less guarded than when meeting unknown mages on public places would merit, since his attainments have given him some confidence on this interaction end results, however he is aware that which magics does, magic can undo or mislead: <i>Divination </i>can be foiled by more advanced magics.<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4967,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","user":"lbeaumanior","date":". 10-24-2024, 12:57 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-24T09:03:17-07:00","id":1544653,"title":"","content":"Olorion looks at the well dressed Thearch and his associates. <i>Well here is the lawyer that Galahad mentioned</i>. \u201cGreetings, I am Olorion of the Mysterium. This is my cabalmate Galahad of the Adamantine Arrow. We are associates of Alunno of the Berkeley cabal. I understand you are here on business for the Hierarch.\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28497-emerys","name":"Emerys","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"40"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-24T09:28:55-07:00","id":1544654,"title":"","content":"<b>Helmut</b> hearing 'guests' names is first confused, but then suddenly fascinated - ecstatic even:<br /> 'O<i>lorion... Alunno... Galahad...'</i> - Big Libertine, adding two plus two, almost yells with excitement at airport.<br /> <br /> '<i>Are you guys from the books?! Those about rings?'</i> - Almost forty years Acanthus is smiling like teenage boy. His rainbow beard seams like it's bright in sunny day, direct in sunlight.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-24T09:54:17-07:00","id":1544658,"title":"","content":"<b>Amir </b>is taken aback a while before remembering <b>Helmut </b>temporal mishaps, he is expecting that <b>Rachel </b>will follow protocol and stay back, as to avoid sharing her personal name and dealing in matters of mages.<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;<b>Helmut </b>here is a bit excitable about cultural matters&quot; </i><b>Amir </b>then shifts his sight to <b>Galahad </b><i>&quot;that being said, this is a retrieval mission, I have our man arrival flight, gate and time; so given the nature of the accusation and the fact the is from your Order I would defer to your instructions on how to handle him security-wise. As for our destination, we are expected in the </i>Better Luck Tomorrow Restaurant<i>, we should use the back entrance. We have a car that my assistant and myself use, and <b>Helmut </b>has a motorcycle&quot;.</i><br /> <br /> <b>Amir </b>is taking charge of the situation, but he is aware that there is a reason for the Orders division of responsibilities, the Arrow has in its remit the martial side of the Pentacle. He rather not have a suspected assassin in the same vehicle with him and <b>Rachel</b>, but in the spirit of cooperation he shares what resources he can bring to fulfil the mission.<br /> <br /> Also, if he has a chance to talk in private he will ask <b>Helmut </b>to stop interjecting, it will be harder to protect him from the expected political fallout if he gets more involved. This is a plot, and once it this delivery is done, he needs to talk to the Archdeacon.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4967,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","user":"lbeaumanior","date":". 10-24-2024, 07:06 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-24T12:01:28-07:00","id":1544665,"title":"","content":"Olorion almost jumped a bit at the rainbow bearded mage\u2019s loud exclamation but quickly calmed himself.<i> I really need to get better with sudden loud noises.</i><br /> <br /> <br /> Olorion smiles amicably at the bearded man and simply says \u201cIndeed, but a topic for another time\u201d. Olorion has to hold himself back from nerding out about books. Olorion turns toward the well dressed lawyer and nodded before speaking:<br /> <br /> <br /> \u201cThat seems a reasonable plan, Mr. Amir. Once you have the suspect in custody, I can offer co-location services if needed. Will the suspect be taken directly to the Consillium?\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28497-emerys","name":"Emerys","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"40"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-24T15:52:33-07:00","id":1544688,"title":"","content":"<i>&quot;Yes as this is a Consilium matter, but I would ask of all of you&quot;</i> says <b>Amir </b>looking each one in turn in the eye<i> &quot;to treat the suspect as innocent until given reason to do otherwise. He has a right to defense and counsel, and if you give the stink eye to someone who ends up being innocent you are souring the future harmony of the Consilium. Of course if matters get violent, we will follow your instructions&quot; </i>he says while nodding to <b>Galahad</b>.<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;Regarding your offer, it would depend on your cabal mate advice and your confidence on taking the suspect to the place I mentioned, while avoiding Sleeper scrutiny&quot; </i>speaking to <b>Olorion</b>.<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-25T02:17:30-07:00","id":1544712,"title":"","content":"Galahad gulps, as if the responsibility for protecting this group of mages and the young sleepwalker woman was unexpected. Galahad thinks of himself more as an analyst then field personnel.<br /> <br /> He looks over to the two Acanthoi, Olorion and Helmut<br /> &quot;Should we look for the um...assassin at the security check point or the luggage claim?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-25T06:45:37-07:00","id":1544723,"title":"","content":"<b>Amir </b>sights internally, <i>of course</i> they would send the least competent involved people they could find, this IS a plot after all.<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;Okay, team, I have cast before arriving and it is my opinion that this is not a risky endeavour, but as good policy we should do it by the book&quot;</i> says <b>Amir </b>while looking at each one when speaking:<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;<b>Helmut</b>, please cast to identify where is our target; and if you are able increase our chances of getting this done right, then stay with my assistant for support, if we get away magically take your vehicles and go home&quot;</i><br /> <br /> <i>&quot;Mister <b>Olorin</b>, a lot might hinge on you, please identify the destination, use Google Maps or whatever can give you a better chance to get there ASAP if needed, and after that start preparing a containment spell, JUST in case our man tries to escape, you will be joining the meet up&quot;</i><br /> <br /> <i>&quot;Mister <b>Galahad</b>, please support me when approaching our man, a familar face will help, but I should be leading the conversation&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Doubts? Questions? Any flaw you see now so we can do this peacefully and quick? I am confident in my </i>Divination <i>but I am unaware of the scope of your capabilities, please share what you can do to increase our success chances&quot;</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4967,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","user":"lbeaumanior","date":". 10-25-2024, 03:17 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-25T12:41:43-07:00","id":1544746,"title":"","content":"Olorion nods his head in affirmation of the plan. Turning towards the rainbow bearded man he says<br /> <br /> &quot;Once you find his location I can scope it out and start laying some ground work to keep him from running if he chooses to do so. &quot;<br /> <br /> Olorion closes his eyes and releases and ends his <i>Perfect Timing </i>spell early. He feels that he needs to be able to concentrate on more complex spells for this operation. <i>Something really weird is definitely happening with all this, but I don't see any other option but to play along especially since the Consillium is involved.</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28497-emerys","name":"Emerys","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"40"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-26T00:10:31-07:00","id":1544784,"title":"","content":"<b>Helmut</b>, don't discouraged for spells weird failing, just says a bit louder:<br /> <i>'I know where Gilad will be! Follow me!'</i><br /> <br /> And like typical bold Acanthus - he just goes behind the security barrier on international flights, to the baggage claim. He <i><b>IS</b></i> Man of the Hour, in the end.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-26T07:07:10-07:00","id":1544791,"title":"","content":"Gilad climbing up the baggage carousel seems to have snapped the people around him from their bored stupor, who call him down. Between gestures and the odd word he recognizes, they are able to communicate just enough so he can retrieve his luggage. Unfortunately, the gathering of people draws a lot of attention and, as he begins to follow the crowd to the next waypoint, he feels he is being followed.<br /> <br /> Remembering a few lessons from the village hunters, Gilad attempts to blend into the crowd, using pillars to break line of sight. When he still feels someone chasing him, he pulls out his incomplete music sheet. He visualizes it as his own personal song in the greater chorus of nature, starting to hear the sounds of his hometown as a distant echo, forming into musical notes that imprint an Imago onto the paper. He folds the sheet, hiding the melody and starts hearing it start to fade. Before it can, sudden notes of discord start playing, trying to draw more attention to it, someone is trying to interfere with his spellwork.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 10-26-2024, 01:14 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-26T12:40:42-07:00","id":1544807,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a> <br /> <br /> Gilad is walking in a dense group of people towards the security checkpoint. He finds himself unable to move forward, as if there is an invisible wall. The sleepers around him continue moving forward, bumping into him, and speaking rudely in English. They can pass through the barrier, but he cannot, like chaff falling through a sieve, leaving only the one kernel of wheat.<br /> <br /> Soon Gilad is behind the crowd he was hiding in.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-27T10:02:02-07:00","id":1544852,"title":"","content":"<b>Amir </b>sights internally again.<br /> <br /> He is just waiting to see how does this play and then will cast a <i>Shifting Sands</i> armed with this foreknowledge redo events: keep <b>Rachel </b>at the office, avoid <b>Helmut </b>involvement in the process, and avoid a breach of the Veil. The Lex is very clear on what could happen to all of them, not to mention Paradox is a potent threat with so many Sleepers around.<br /> <br /> As an Acanthus, Time is flexible, but he is dissapointed that all of this has been dropped on his lap while he could be focusing on his own personal goals.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-28T13:04:28-07:00","id":1544911,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a><br /> <br /> Gilad notices a young mother pushing a baby in a small cart that lets the infant sit upright like a chair. The baby is waving his little arms about (Mudra?) and babbling (High Speech?). He turns and sees an old man in servant's clothes with a mop and a bucket. The old man is moving the mop around in a suggestive way. <br /> <br /> He senses that he is now surrounded on all four sides by invisible walls. The air goes still, and it becomes very silent.<br /> <br /> He hears a voice in his head. <i>The average adult human being at rest consumes about one cubic foot of breathable air every four minutes. Please do not try to struggle.<br /> <br /> We are the Guardians of the Veil in this city. We have some questions for you.</i><br /> <br /> Gilad turns to face the mother and child again, but they are not there anymore. Instead he sees a <a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?sa=i&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.gq.com%2Fgallery%2Fdavid-bowie-style-icon&amp;psig=AOvVaw1FfuFxR1Mu-kdUqH2lphK8&amp;ust=1730231771330000&amp;source=images&amp;cd=vfe&amp;opi=89978449&amp;ved=0CBQQjRxqFwoTCKDGpujtsYkDFQAAAAAdAAAAABAS\" target=\"_blank\">tall slim man in a suit</a>. Gilad gets the sense that if he tries to speak with his mind, the man will understand him.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-28T14:43:56-07:00","id":1544926,"title":"","content":"&quot;Sir, you cannot enter the airport here. Stop moving. If you are here to pick someone up, please wait over there.&quot; <br /> <br /> Helmut sees five security guards with hands on their holstered non-lethal weapons stepping towards him. Several of the qued passengers look to see what is going on. One of them seems to be humming the tune to &quot;<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ohio_%28Crosby%2C_Stills%2C_Nash_%26_Young_song%29?wprov=sfla1\" target=\"_blank\">Ohio</a>&quot; by Crosby, Stills, Nash and Young. Clearly he is thinking about the 60's.<br /> <br /> Helmut has a memory flashback to the riot where he awakened. He remembers cops beating Vanguard activists and drag queens from the dinner.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-28T17:44:27-07:00","id":1544946,"title":"","content":"&quot;<i>Looks like I am going nowhere. Guardians being careful of a dangerous mage ? Seers trying to check something ? First I need to confirm that, without being yesterday's grouse's son.&quot;</i><br /> <br /> Gilad thinks back to his lessons on the basics of magical law, focusing his thoughts in the general direction of the man in the suit.<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;What do you wish to know ?&quot;</i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-28T19:40:20-07:00","id":1544950,"title":"","content":"Gilad feels his passive mage sight, and the air begins to move again.<br /> <br /> <i>We are wondering what you are doing here in San Francisco. You traveled alone. You don't know anyone in the city. You have no reason to be here. Your circle was traveling under the assumed identity of a folk music group. Your public touring schedule has no performances here. These are all curious facts, don't you think? You're a fascinating person.</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-29T01:32:38-07:00","id":1544955,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CalvinSiler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1543784-a-search-for-lost-time-mtaw-2e-chronicle-ic?p=1544926#post1544926\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;Sir, you cannot enter the airport here. Stop moving. If you are here to pick someone up, please wait over there.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div><b>Helmut</b> is of two minds. On hand, he just want to find <b>Gilad</b> and help him. He deeply understand person that can be confused in 'future' from his original timeline. On another, this all 'needless control' thing stinks of influence of at least Lie, if not Seers themselves. And now 'police with guns' going very much on bad memories of 1960s. <br /> <br /> He try to cool down and talk with Sleepers. But preparing his Time Shield in the event of brawl with Sleepers.<br /> <br /> Big hippie say calmly:<br /> 'I look for my friend that probably got confused. He is...' - <b>Helmut</b> thinks how to phrase that he looks for guy who is probably time displaced Viking from circa 10th or earlier century.<br /> 'He is from other culture. He did not was on USA airport before. He is probably confused. Scandinavian...'<br /> <br /> Helmut now realized that they hadn't given him a description of what the Viking looked like. Argh, <b>Amir</b>!<br /> <br /> If Sleepers are still pointing guns to him, he slowly going in front of them. Maybe they are not like police from 1960s in the way. Helmut just <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-29T05:05:22-07:00","id":1544961,"title":"","content":"About 50 meters away, near the baggage carousel, Helmut sees a tall, lean and muscular blond man with a warrior's bearing. He is standing very still, and looks like he is deep in thought. Near by he sees another man who looks like 1980's David Bowie in a grey double breasted suit who also looks &quot;deep in thought&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-29T05:18:28-07:00","id":1544962,"title":"","content":"The Guardian looks up at something in the far distance behind Gilad. The expression on his face is something between frustration and amusement.<br /> <br /> <i>Ah. It seems the Hierarch has seen fit to send...um...backup. I will leave you in their...um...capable hands.</i><br /> <br /> He looks a little like a cat being forced to give up a mouse. He and the servant with the mop move away from Gilad and disappear in a crowd of newly arrived passengers. <br /> <br /> Gilad is no longer restrained by the ward &quot;box&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83e\udd70","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-29T06:27:11-07:00","id":1544966,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CalvinSiler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1543784-a-search-for-lost-time-mtaw-2e-chronicle-ic?p=1544961#post1544961\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">About 50 meters away, near the baggage carousel, Helmut sees a tall, lean and muscular blond man with a warrior's bearing.</div> </div> </div> </div><b>Helmut</b> waves his hand very cheering in his direction - like young school girl seeing her best friend on hallway. Rembering Gilad is probably OG Viking, hippie calls in old Norse ( or at least what he thinks it is ):<br /> \u200b\u200b\u200b'Here Glad, great warrior! Aesier send me to help.'<br /> <br /> <b>Helmut</b> turn in front to Sleepers 'police' hoping to defuse situation and says:<br /> 'Here is my friend, let me just help him to pass those gates. He is from .. other culture.'","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 10-29-2024, 09:31 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-29T07:53:41-07:00","id":1544975,"title":"","content":"Gilad is a bit surprised.<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;It seems my request for safe passage came through, and just when I needed it the most.&quot;</i><br /> <br /> Gilad turns in the direction of the one who called his name, he doesn't fully know what he said, but he heard him mention the Aesir. As soon as he sees the man, he understands. The Bifr\u00f6st colored beard, the crystals that grant sight beyond sight and the ceremonial robes. Clearly he is a shaman of Heimdall, who had a vision of this happening. <br /> <br /> Gilad hails him back in Old Norse: &quot;Well met, farseer ! You arrived at the perfect time&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83e\udd70","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-29T09:00:48-07:00","id":1544986,"title":"","content":"<b>Helmut</b> suddenly understand he don't truly know Old Norse - only can <i>sound</i> as saying like that. Trying to fix communication with <b>Gilad</b>, he use his Mind magics and made energetic great hands gesture's like 'come with me'. <br /> <br /> <b>Helmut</b> TRYS to say in Old Norse:<br /> <i>'Gilad, come with me, Hierarch is waiting. Aesir send me to help you.' </i><br /> <br /> ( Rolls on Mind Scan spell and language understanding are on OOC topic. )","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-29T09:26:00-07:00","id":1544991,"title":"","content":"The TSA security backs down somewhat after they realize that Helmut is a normal San Francisco hippie crazy person, and not a &quot;Kill everyone&quot; crazy person. They make him wait for Gilad to get through security with his bag, and ask him to sign a document that says he is being finned $500 for breaking the law, or he can fight it in court.<br /> <br /> As Gilad makes it through the security, he places his mobile phone and Trish's mobile phone in the tray before going through the scanner. The X- ray machine seems to hiccup a little as Trish's phone goes through. The TSA worker thinks this is a little strange and tries again. The machine works normally the second time and Gilad is allowed to pass into the public entrance of the airport after being thoroughly searched and patted down.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-29T15:30:29-07:00","id":1545008,"title":"","content":"Olorion looks at the man to whom the Silver Ladder lawyer is speaking. Breathing in and out he prepared to spring a containment spell through the use of the Space arcana. Olorion inches slowly to stand nearer to the mage being addressed in a deliberate and non-threatening way. The man seems to have some confusion when hearing others talking out loud, <i>I wonder what language he speaks and where he is from? Everything about this situation is odd. </i><br /> <br /> Olorion breaths in and out while moving twisting the ring on his finger. Deciding not to chant as not to drawn attention to himself, Olorion reaches out with his mind, feelings the threads and chains that bind the minds of all thinking beings together he grabs one that feels right and attempt to use <i>Mental Scan</i> on the unknown mage. Aiming to get a sense of three things: the general state of mind, the mage's most imperative desire, and the shape of the language he might speak. Pushing a little harder Olorion tries to feel and interpret the surface thoughts of the mage.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28497-emerys","name":"Emerys","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"40"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-29T17:06:38-07:00","id":1545013,"title":"","content":"Olorion's perspective shifts to a lodge made of carved wood. The sounds of songs, drink and stories echo throughout the halls, keeping winter's bite at bay. The scenery shifts once more, this time to a town with Swedish style architecture, to an instructor walking him through different adjustments in stance in a myriad different combat scenarios.<br /> <br /> As Gilad looks through the group, he is taken aback for a minute <i>&quot;Galahad was not killed when time shifted ? That is a relief. Next I need to confirm for Trish, I must get the evidence to the Consilium.&quot;</i><br /> <br /> Gilad's vocabulary is not enough to understand what the solemn statement was, he pauses for a moment.<br /> <br /> &quot;Galahad, I am glad to see you escaped this mess in the last drop. I am not sure what that stern fellow just asked, but I assume he is trying to keep work in the glove.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 10-29-2024, 08:18 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-29T17:23:15-07:00","id":1545018,"title":"","content":"Olorion's mind is filled with images of Nordic life and song. The beauty of the language was delightful as it filled his mind and soul. Looking at the unknown mage he says in a friendly tone:<br /> <br /> &lt;Old Norse&gt; Do you understand the Thearch brother mage? &lt;Old Norse&gt;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28497-emerys","name":"Emerys","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"40"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-29T17:33:29-07:00","id":1545021,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a><br /> <br /> Galahad is indeed alive. But he seems very different from what Gilad remembers. He remembers Galahad as being a strong and courageous warrior who had no fear fighting the Abyss and was a brilliant swordsman. This Galahad looks like a clerk and someone who has heard songs about battles but has never been in one.<br /> <br /> Galahad looks at Gilad, and doesn't seem to recognize him at all like he is a complete stranger. He looks over to Olorion. &quot;I'm not sure what he just said. My Old Norse is not that good.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-29T17:40:39-07:00","id":1545023,"title":"","content":"<b>Amir </b>signals <b>Olorin </b>and <b>Galahad </b>to approach as he gets closer to <b>Helmut</b>.<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;<b>Helmut</b>, thanks for your help finding the man, what did he say to you?&quot;</i> <b>Amir </b>enquires<i> &quot;and please next time, don't run away without explaining, we were expecting you to tell us his location without moving, so <b>Olorin </b>could scry and contain if required&quot;</i><br /> <br /> Speaking to <b>Rachel</b>, <i>&quot;Stay close to our effusive friend, and if we go away misteriously take your car and go home&quot;</i><br /> <br /> While approaching <b>Gilad</b>:<br /> <br /> &quot;<i><b>Gilad</b>? </i><i>In the name of the San Francisco Consilium you are being detained for questioning pertaining your last mission.&quot;</i><br /> <br /> <i>&quot;You have the right to remain silent. Anything you say can and will be used against you in a Consilium court. You have the right to talk to a lawyer for advice before we ask you any questions. You have the right to have a lawyer with you during questioning. If you cannot name a lawyer, one will be appointed for you before any questioning if you wish. If you decide to answer questions now without a lawyer present, you have the right to stop answering at any time.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Do you understand each of these rights? Having these rights in mind, do you wish to talk to us now?</i>\u200b&quot;\u200b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-29T17:45:08-07:00","id":1545025,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28497-emerys\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28497\" data-vbnamecard=\"28497\">Emerys</a><br /> <br /> <i>&quot;What severe change managed to undo his training and kill the entire cabal ?&quot;</i><br /> <br /> &quot;I did not understand him, it is odd that Galahad does not understand me either. But I am getting ahead of myself, I am Gilad, but I imagine the farseer has mentioned it. What are you called ? You speak the old tongue well&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-30T15:26:05-07:00","id":1545071,"title":"","content":"\u201cMy name is Olorion. I am a member of the Mysterium. You know my cabalmate Galahad?\u201d<br /> <br /> Olorion remains confused especially with the stray thought he managed to pick up. <i>We need to get our group out of here, something has happened. We need to be able to use some seriously divination magic to find out what is going on and all these Sleepers are getting in the way. </i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28497-emerys","name":"Emerys","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"40"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-30T15:46:43-07:00","id":1545074,"title":"","content":"&quot;Well met Olorion. I know Galahad, but I believe he no longer knows me. Time has shifted and he has alongside it, but my memories have not.&quot;<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;If he is alive, it means Trish might be. Maybe more members of Utopia survived, I need to know more.&quot;</i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-31T09:51:27-07:00","id":1545097,"title":"","content":"<b>Amir </b>is confused by the developments, <b>Gilad </b>does not speak English at all? But then how did this whole &quot;send him to the Andes&quot; started? Having a constantly casted spell is taxing the team resources and that just for basic communication.<br /> <br /> Furthermore, they are going to attract attention, he asks <b>Olorin </b><i>&quot;Can you extend the language capabilities to me or confirm that he complies with our orders? He does not seem hostile, and I think the time for explanations is better served at our destination. Also, do you think you could discretely take us there now?&quot;</i><br /> <br /> He looks at <b>Gilad</b>, the man seems lost in more than one way, and since the Divination has confirmed his innocence, he is another victim of this plot. <b>Amir </b>thinks to himself that he will fight for this man innocence, even if just to spite those plotters.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4967,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","user":"lbeaumanior","date":". 10-31-2024, 10:15 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-01T09:27:46-07:00","id":1545139,"title":"","content":"Olorion looks between the two mages with some confusion and concern leaking onto his face. At the mention of temporal changes Olorion turns to Amir and states: <br /> <br /> \u201cPer our associate here time is being <i>strange</i><i> and flexible</i> around himself and others. I agree we should regroup somewhere less out in the open. I will need a more private space such as a janitor\u2019s closet or similar\u2019\u2019<br /> <br /> Turning toward Gilad and addressing him:<br /> <br /> \u201dWould you accompany us to a more secure location, much appears in flux. The consillium here is quite fair and just, you will not be harmed if you come with us willingly. I am afraid that with the chaos of the changes you have perceived that something larger is at play and we are all likely in danger.\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28497-emerys","name":"Emerys","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"40"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-01T10:33:13-07:00","id":1545143,"title":"","content":"Gilad nods.<br /> <br /> &quot;That was my intent, I had messaged my liaison with the Arrow High Command to arrange safe passage and legal council. Once we reach a safe location, I will need to notify him about meeting you, and about the Guardians attempting to question me before I could find a lawyer.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-01T12:34:55-07:00","id":1545146,"title":"","content":"<b>Helmut</b> is a bit confused, but sensing it's all related to Time Mystery played before his very eyes.<br /> <i>'So, for now, we all shut up and wait to spell the beans until we go to safe location, yes? If it is, can we just move on with that? I feel you all saying the same thing &quot;we need to be safe to talk more&quot;, guys.' </i>- <b>Helmut</b> suddenly looks on <b>Reachel</b>, slightly embarrassed by his faux paux - '<i>And ma'am.'</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-01T14:06:39-07:00","id":1545155,"title":"","content":"Rachel seems most confused of all. Just an few hours ago, she was at work, doing her completely normal job. Now she is surrounded by men, some of whom are acting like they are talking but they aren't saying anything, some speaking some language she has never heard before. And one who seems definitely crazy - was that like a &quot;suicide by cop&quot; attempt or what?<br /> <br /> &quot;Oh. Um...I'm only 22. You don't have to call me ma'am. Rachel. Rachel is my name.&quot; <br /> <br /> She looks at Amir. &quot;So...do you want me to go get my car from the parking garage?&quot;<br /> <br /> Galahad suddenly snaps out of his daze of confusion, seemingly greatful for the opportunity to perform a relatively straightforward task. <br /> <br /> &quot;I can go with her. Um...for protection.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-01T18:22:44-07:00","id":1545184,"title":"","content":"<b>Amir </b>sights, and this time not internally, so much for using 'my assistant' to protect <b>Rachel </b>name and give her a modicum of safety.<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;Thanks for the offer please accompany her&quot;</i> he says looking at <b>Galahad </b>and then looking a <b>Olorin </b><i>&quot;we could just find a discrete location to depart&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;My friend, a minute of your time?&quot; </i>while looking at <b>Helmut</b><i> &quot;privately if you can?&quot; </i>while tapping his head.<br /> <br /> He thinks at <b>Helmut</b>, <i>&quot;Thanks for your help, you have put the man at ease. I need to be fast before the others start thinking we are conspiring... I tried to contain your risk but this is a political matter now, for your own protection you might want to limit your involvement. Of course, it is your choice but there is little to gain and lots to lose from continuing to associate with this&quot;</i> while looking a <b>Gilad </b><i>&quot;...innocent people blamed...&quot;</i> looking at <b>Rachel</b><i>&quot;...ingenue children at risk ...&quot;</i> and looking again at <b>Helmut </b><i>&quot;Of course I will aid you in the matter you requested, it might just be a bit delayed with this situation&quot;.</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4967,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","user":"lbeaumanior","date":". 11-01-2024, 10:22 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-01T18:35:04-07:00","id":1545185,"title":"","content":"Galahad and Rachel leave towards the exit for the garage.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-01T21:48:12-07:00","id":1545194,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>lbeaumanior</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1543784-a-search-for-lost-time-mtaw-2e-chronicle-ic?p=1545184#post1545184\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">He thinks at <b>Helmut</b>, <i>&quot;Thanks for your help, you have put the man at ease. I need to be fast before the others start thinking we are conspiring... I tried to contain your risk but this is a political matter now, for your own protection you might want to limit your involvement. Of course, it is your choice but there is little to gain and lots to lose from continuing to associate with this&quot;</i> while looking a <b>Gilad </b><i>&quot;...innocent people blamed...&quot;</i> looking at <b>Rachel</b><i>&quot;...ingenue children at risk ...&quot;</i> and looking again at <b>Helmut </b><i>&quot;Of course I will aid you in the matter you requested, it might just be a bit delayed with this situation&quot;.</i></div> </div> </div> </div><b>Helmut</b> looks around when majority of team disappeared from scene, evidently waiting to answer <b>Amir</b> when room will be much more emptier:<br /> <i>'Amir, my man. I will not leave this as it is. I literally stumble about this Time Mystery of Disappearing Flower Shop on my own. Your 'guest' is time displaced Viking, confused hundred times more than me when I first show up in 2022. And he was harassed by actors that I can only describe as Followers of the Lie. My Libertine heart is boiling. Man, Fates are pointing me to take up this case.'</i> -<br /> <br /> He makes a bit breather, mulling over what he should talk about to <b>Amir</b>, looking deep in to his eyes.<br /> <i>'I'm guy who came from the past to show you all better future. As a Man of Hour, you should know I need to fix things. And some old man's Concilium be damn if they get in my way of making world better - even for this poor Viking and this petit girl you have here. No, some 'old man club', dressed in funny robes, judging others by ancient laws - will not stop me. Not too mention i feel that Mysteries literally pointed me to you all, guys.'</i><br /> <br /> Breaths with a deep sight, but continues:<br /> <i>'I know we have... management issues, you and me, Amir. But even if you will not take me to your working CABAL, coven, circle or whatever you will call this...' </i>- <b>Helmut</b> hands dramatically on all the other mages in the room. - '<i>I still will be following this case. Norns are pointing me to do this. I was even called as 'farseer of Heimdall'.' </i>- Big hippie chuckle for second.<br /> <br /> <b>Helmut</b>'s face is stone serious. His eyes are deep as his hugging arms - and his soul:<br /> <i>'I NEED to do this. And I know, deep inside this a bit twisted mind, you also want to help those people, Amir. Knowing you, I think you already planing their defense against Consillium. Let me help and let both of us do good for all the people.'</i><br /> <br /> And suddenly, Helmut hums a few verses under his nose. Not casting, just remembering words of song....<br /> <br /> <i>'\u2026 Open up your heart, let it shine on in (the sunshine in)<br /> You got to feel it (let the sunshine)<br /> You got to feel it (let the sunshine in)<br /> Open up your heart and let it shine on in (the sunshine in)'</i><br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ajgeaOt_HTQ\" data-code=\"ajgeaOt_HTQ\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/ajgeaOt_HTQ/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 11-02-2024, 12:52 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-04T10:07:08-08:00","id":1545323,"title":"","content":"<b>Amir </b>is touched by <b>Helmut</b>'s comments. The Free Council maybe be many things, but they are not cowards nor they will let innocents hang.<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;Alright, let's do this man!&quot;</i> he says vocally<i> &quot;pick your ride, we are going to meet the loyal opposition&quot;.</i><br /> <br /> To <b>Olorin </b><i>&quot;Please share with our guest that we are going to the Consilium assigned location, are you up to make this trip for us with you skills or shall we use our vehicles?&quot;</i><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4967,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","user":"lbeaumanior","date":". 11-04-2024, 03:47 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-04T11:51:24-08:00","id":1545332,"title":"","content":"<b>Helmut</b> is smiling with big grin, puting his old style motorcycle goggles on head - turns to other Awakened in vicinity - and tells with raised voice:<br /> <i>'I have one extra seat with Unicorn. Who want to ride with Heimdall's farseerer?!'</i><br /> <br /> \u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200bSeeing a bit confusion with the mages crowd:<br /> '<i>Unicorn is my Harley bike. I have passager seat in it for one good soul.'</i> \ud83d\ude0e","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-04T17:36:25-08:00","id":1545352,"title":"","content":"Gilad takes a moment to consider <i>&quot;I do not know this area or the full situation, I should be mindful not to put them in undue risk&quot;</i><br /> <br /> &quot;How should we distribute our numbers then ? Should I alter my appearance to draw less attention or do you expect an uneventful travel to this safe bastion ?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 11-04-2024, 09:27 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-04T18:26:27-08:00","id":1545358,"title":"","content":"Olorion turns to Amir, \u201cI can open a portal if we can find a place away from all these Sleepers but will be honest that we could induce paradox if not careful. If we have enough vehicles and this gentleman is amenable I would say lets try and use mundane transport. Too much is going on and variable.\u201d<br /> <br /> Turning toward Gilad, \u201cWould you be willing to come with us by car. A horseless chariot to take us to our destination. We mean you no harm.\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28497-emerys","name":"Emerys","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"40"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-04T18:28:57-08:00","id":1545360,"title":"","content":"Gilad nods<br /> <br /> &quot;Very well, I am ready to depart at any moment&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-04T19:10:11-08:00","id":1545363,"title":"","content":"Olorion turns to Amir, <br /> <br /> \u201cHe is willing to come with us in a car. If you have room in your car for both of us, or if we rent one I can extend my gift of languages to you\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28497-emerys","name":"Emerys","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"40"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-04T19:30:49-08:00","id":1545369,"title":"","content":"About 20 minutes later, Rachel and Galahad pull up in Rachel's car, which is a reasonably roomy SUV with a good safety report (her mom and dad worry about things like that).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-05T14:18:04-08:00","id":1545410,"title":"","content":"<b>Amir </b>waits for <b>Olorin </b>to do the translation but he encourages the man again <i>&quot;I will really appreciate having the same translation capacity on me, it would make easier to explain our guest his rights and obligations&quot;.<br /> <br /> &quot;And if there is no opposition, I think we could all go in my assistant's car, unless you brought your own rides&quot;.</i><br /> <br /> <b>Amir </b>is furiously thinking what do to do when they arrive at the restaurant. Will they allow <b>Olorin </b>to stay as translation services? Will <b>Galahad </b>be tasked to guard the man? What to do with <b>Helmut</b>'s quest? He has no reasonable excuse to stay, but this is something that the man clearly wants to do. And of course, how to protect <b>Gilad</b>'s life long enough to inform the Archdeacon of all of this privately? He casts some Divinations using his attainments, and satified that the results all seem positive, he decides to go through the plan.<br /> <br /> While walking to the cars, he sends a message to the Archdeacon<i> &quot;There is an urgent matter relevant to the Order, currently on a mission for the Hierach. At your earliest convenience I must share details&quot;</i><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4967,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","user":"lbeaumanior","date":". 11-08-2024, 10:05 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-08T15:38:35-08:00","id":1545589,"title":"","content":"Gilad sees the others arranging the details of the journey and remembers he has ones to make himself.<br /> <br /> &quot;I will send an messenger through my crystal speaker to Lucas, our liason to Arrow high command&quot;<br /> <br /> Gilad opens his crystal speaker, checking for any updates, before typing.<br /> <br /> &quot;I have made contact with the Awakened farseer Helmut, the scholar Olorion, the time changed Galahad, the lawgiver Amir and the Sleepwalker Rachel. The Guardians tried to intercept me before I could find safe passage, but the farseer had seen through their attempt. We are going to discuss how to present my case before the Consilium's lodge.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 11-08-2024, 06:42 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-09T02:14:24-08:00","id":1545607,"title":"","content":"Rachel is driving, the seat pushed forward so that her eyeline is above the dashboard. Gilad is beside her, and Amir is in the back. Galahad decides to take up Helmut on his offer to ride on the sidecar of Un1corn.<br /> <br /> Amir receives a text back from one of the Archdeacon's staff. <br /> <br /> &quot;The Archdeacon is unable to be disturbed right now because of a mater related to the recent disappearances in your cryptopoly. I will convey your message as soon as the Archdeacon is done meditating.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-09T02:58:08-08:00","id":1545608,"title":"","content":"<b>Helmut</b>, driving on Un1c0rn with <b>Galahad</b>, directing a questions to him:<br /> <i>'So, umm.... Galahad... Are you... British? Are you knight? Taken from of Myths of King Arthur?'</i> <br /> Helmut's voice is deep, but it contains obvious notes of teenager's curiosity<br /> Harley Davidson is rowing lowly in the street traffic just before midnight.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-09T13:37:34-08:00","id":1545623,"title":"","content":"&quot;Nope. I'm...not British. I've never been to England actually. I..um...studied Medieval Literature and awoke while reading the ancient legends of King Arthur. Galahad was one of the Knights of Camelot who helps the king seek the Holy Grail&quot;<br /> <br /> Galahad then goes in to a long academic discussion of the lore of King Arthur, and his own theories about Merlin Emrys and Camelot. Lost Camelot is clearly his mage obsession.<br /> <br /> &quot;I like to think that I am a knight of sorts,&quot; he says with a mixture of pride and sheepishness.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-09T16:40:40-08:00","id":1545626,"title":"","content":"[Editing away double post]","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 11-09-2024, 07:44 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-09T16:40:40-08:00","id":1545627,"title":"","content":"As the sit in the iron carriage, Gilad is pondering the recent events, and is reminded of a lesson from his training. A tale that spoke of a Time master who was able to preserve a knife from a shift in the timeline, such that there was no other reason for it to exist in the new timeline. He considers the story and how similar it is to what happened to Trish's crystal talkbox.<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;But I do not hear the melody of magic from it, perhaps it is Veiled. But I should keep my own counsel until we can speak safely&quot;</i><br /> <br /> Gilad shelves the thought for the moment and tilts his head back to Olorion.<br /> <br /> &quot;It was very fortunate that you are a scholar that speaks the old tongue. I was told few study it today, did you learn it while pursuing a Mystery ?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 11-09-2024, 08:02 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-09T23:29:17-08:00","id":1545637,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CalvinSiler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1543784-a-search-for-lost-time-mtaw-2e-chronicle-ic?p=1545623#post1545623\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;Nope. I'm...not British. I've never been to England actually. I..um...studied Medieval Literature and awoke while reading the ancient legends of King Arthur. Galahad was one of the Knights of Camelot who helps the king seek the Holy Grail.</div> </div> </div> </div><b>Helmut</b> continues:<br /> '<i>Galahad... Galahad... Are you Obrimos? Are you chosen by God? I've heard about few years pas massive Awakenings for Obrimoi coming from some 'divine radio signal' or something?'</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-12T12:00:53-08:00","id":1545750,"title":"","content":"&quot;Yeah. I'm an Obrimos. I...uh...I guess so. I'm not sure if I beleve in a 'god'. It's not like I heard a voice or anything.&quot; Galahad shouts, trying to be heard over the noise of the bike engine.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-12T13:19:03-08:00","id":1545752,"title":"","content":"<i>'But you literally chosen name of Knight looking for the Graail... If I remember correctly, it was God that send Galahad on this quest...'</i> - <b>Helmut</b> is a bit confused on all this 'Shadow Name symbology' all the Diamond mages partake in.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-13T05:15:38-08:00","id":1545781,"title":"","content":"Gawain begins babbling in a scholarly way about old French romances and celtic myths and druid rituals, and at one point starts reciting something in Latin. Helmut is more familiar with Norse and Greek myth, so he is not sure everything Gawain is saying.<br /> <br /> &quot;I don't know. I think what we call 'god' is an emergent property of impersonal cosmic forces. I suppose Alunno would say that I have not sufficiently explored the mystery of the <i>Prima Materia</i>. But who created the legends and myths. No one person. They form into the expression we know now as part of an evolutionary process of memes. Or like a medieval cathedral. Architects and builders each adding their part to a whole than can't be attributed to any one creator or designer. I don't know. I guess I'm still trying to figure it out.:","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-13T06:08:28-08:00","id":1545782,"title":"","content":"<b>Helmut</b> is thinking rest of the way to restaurant on words of Galahad. Maybe Fallen-Supernal relation is not as straight forward as he thought of it. Hippie driver immerse in the driving on San Fran streets.<br /> <br /> ( <b>Helmut</b> will nit say anything untill they come to restaurant or Galahad starts new topic. )","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-14T16:02:02-08:00","id":1545890,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>Chapter 2 &quot;Somebody that I used to know&quot;</b></span><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"font-size:11px\">&quot;I've never fallen asleep driving. But I've woken up driving&quot; <br /> - Steven Wright</span></i><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-size:11px\">About a year ago...</span></b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:11px\">Amir pulls up to the house and gets out of the Uber. Laura said that this is where he should go. That he would find her here. There is trash all over the lawn, and the front door is wide open. Loud music is blaring from inside. He walks inside. The floor is littered with red plastic cups and the place reeks of cheap beer, sweat, pot smoke and pheramones. Amir walks from room to room and finds undergrad frat types passed out everywhere. But none of the test subjects. None of the members of the &quot;Hypnopompic Circle&quot;. Laura, the sleeper who leads the cult, is no where to be found either. Did she take them somewhere else? What is going on?<br /> <br /> Amir slowly walks up stairs to the bedrooms. Similarly, rooms full of sleeping co-eds. He opens a door and finds a girl passed out on a bed. She is a small, pudgy Chinese girl in preppy, &quot;good kid&quot; clothes. Next to her head is a note. It's in Atlantean. &quot;This place is a mess. Fix your Sh**, Acolyte.&quot; It says, and then has the rune of the Guardians of the Veil.<br /> <br /> The girl on the bed stirs, and then slowly starts to wake up. &quot;Where am I?&quot; she says, &quot;Is this...real. Am I awake?&quot; She looks over at Amir, &quot;Wait...I know you...from...somewhere. Have you come to...show me the way.&quot; She lays back down, seemingly from exhaustion. Not fully awake, or asleep.<br /> <br /> Amir hears the sounds of police sirens. He tries to wake the girl back up. Searching around, he finds her purse, and car keys.</span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-14T17:53:39-08:00","id":1545896,"title":"","content":"Rachel parks the car near the restaurant. In large neon letters the sign above the storefront says &quot;Better Luck Tomorrow Restaurant&quot; along with the Chinese characters. The first floor has a take-out counter attended by a employee who nods to Amir, Olorion, and Gilad as they make their way to the stairs that lead up to the dining room. Helmut and Galahad arive about the same time and Helmut parks Un1corn.<br /> <br /> Along the wall of the stairwell are framed photos of many notable and famous citizens of the city dining in the restaurant. Gilad looks for Trish, but he doesn't see her face.<br /> <br /> The restaurant dining room is furnished in dark wood paneling and expensive red carpeting and curtains. One wall is a tank with exotic fish. There is low ambient music playing in the background. There are large family style tables with a turning table in the middle. The restaurant is empty.<br /> <br /> A Maitre'd in an expensive dark suit and hair cut approaches.<br /> &quot;Ah, yes. You are here for the private party,&quot; he says, bowing slightly to each of the will workers. &quot;This way gentleman. The lady will need to wait here,&quot; he says, glancing over at Rachel.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-17T19:59:55-08:00","id":1546058,"title":"","content":"<b>Amir </b>looks at <b>Rachel </b>smiling reasuringly, thanks the maitre'd and ask him for a moment to convey something to the gathering.<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;My friends, thanks for your help here, I will ask you to be careful on the meeting, an outburst might influence <b>Gilad</b> situation negatively</i><i>&quot; </i>he takes the time to look each one in the eye and says with as much seriousness as he can<i> &quot;I know this can sound domineering coming from a member of the Silver Ladder, but if you are unsure of what to say, just stay silent and allow me to take the lead; this is what I do as part of my profession&quot;.</i><br /> <br /> <i>&quot;Just to be clear, <b>Gilad </b>&quot;</i> looking at the man<i> &quot;is not FORMALLY accused of anything yet. But I want us to be prepared, and that includes caution against someone trying to pass immediate judgement&quot;</i> looking at <b>Olorin </b>and using his palm to indicate <b>Gilad</b><i> &quot;Please share that with our friend and if possible put the translation spell on me, I wish to avoid miscomunications or someone '</i>forgetting<i>' to provide him with translation services&quot;.<br /> <br /> &quot;Anything to add? No? Then, let's get this done&quot;.</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4967,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","user":"lbeaumanior","date":". 11-20-2024, 10:05 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-20T06:42:16-08:00","id":1546192,"title":"","content":"Gilad hears the translation.<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;I was told we came here to discuss my case, but it seems I will be rushed to judgment. If those words he said are the law, then I will hold him to it.&quot;</i><br /> <br /> Mindful of what was said, he contains his outrage, but as he turns to speak to Amir, his voice is even, but unmistakably more stern.<br /> <br /> &quot;How can a lawyer speak to the Consilium's lodge if they know nothing of what I saw ? How can I defend myself from accusations I do not know and from a time I was never in ? This is a serious matter, the people affected by this time shift are dead or missing. If this Mystery is dismissed, they will remain so. If I have the right for legal counsel, then I will take counsel before standing before the Consilium.&quot;<br /> <br /> Gilad looks at Olorion and Helmut<br /> <br /> &quot;Please let him know what I just said&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-28T18:07:28-08:00","id":1546479,"title":"","content":"&quot;<a href=\"https://tuna.voicemod.net/sound/f0ff7ea0-e799-482a-8596-9d47874beccf\" target=\"_blank\">Hey Listen</a>! This is crazy guys!&quot; says Galahad, &quot;Look, I don't know this guy, but we can't just let him walk in there without something to say other than that he says he didn't kill anybody&quot;.<br /> <br /> Galahad gets out his phone and starts doing some furious typing. He seems to perform some ritual with his phone and a mudra.<br /> <br /> &quot;OK. I hacked into the airline database. There's no record of me being on the plane obviously. But this Trish Takahashi Gilad says was with him isn't on the flight manifest either.&quot;<br /> <br /> He does some more typing.<br /> <br /> &quot;OK. So Gilad says that Trish is a 'famous chronicler and storyteller'. But there's no one named Trish Takahashi that works for a newspaper here in the city, or anywhere else. It's like she doesn't exist. So if that&quot; Galahad points to the phone in Gilad's hand ,&quot;is her phone, then it means there's been some time distortion&quot;. He looks at Amir, Olorion, and Helmut.<br /> <br /> &quot;Well, is there a time distortion? What do you see? And if so when did the timelines diverge? That should be enough to convince the councilors to at least let us investigate further.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-29T08:36:06-08:00","id":1546482,"title":"","content":"&quot;I agree. I have not studied the spells of Time, but somehow here I am. Which means both me and this crystal speaker were Shielded from the changes in it's flow. Maybe that spell is still active and Veiled, or we could look back to when time shifted. If we see the caster's Nimbus, that might count as evidence. But Trish's situation has one more dog buried in it. She was traveling to visit her family on the San Francisco hold, I wonder if even their history shifted&quot;<br /> <br /> Gilad takes a deep breath and thinks back, using the memory techniques he was thought in his village, visualizing a lodge where the events of his last quest were captured in cravings on the wall and mementos hung in display.<br /> <br /> &quot;I have a good memory, I can describe the Seers and Scelestus we routed, in case one of them is a 